[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p>1. Release and remove the bottom right trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046905.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air mixture flap actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N81</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the air conditioner air mixer flap motor</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046906.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the air conditioner air\nmixer flap motor and tighten the fixing bolts.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the mixer flap motor has to\nbe replaced, the new components must undergo the Proxi initialisation procedure\nusing the diagnostic station (Examiner).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Air mixture flap actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N81</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the bottom right trim and check that\nit is secure.</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]